-- Smoothcomp organizer aliases activated 2026-10-04 (EXC-166)
--
-- APPLIED RECORD. Founder's word, 2026-10-04: "add those 36 organisers".
-- These exact statements were applied to almanac-staging and then to
-- production (almanac) on 2026-10-05 around 03:45 UTC (the evening of
-- 2026-10-04 in America/Chicago). Do not re-apply: host is UNIQUE, so a
-- second run fails on purpose. Production went from 6 to 28 active aliases.
--
-- How each host was cleared (every request: pinned user agent from
-- scout/src/identity.js, one 11-second clock across all Smoothcomp hosts,
-- redirects recorded and never followed; terms page first, per the
-- 2026-09-26 founder ruling that research reads follow Scout's crawl law):
--   1. smoothcomp.com/en/events/upcoming (the reviewed global calendar):
--      35 subdomains beyond the active 6 carry US events in the next 12 months.
--   2. Per host: /en/agreements (404 on all 35), then robots.txt
--      (byte-identical to smoothcomp.com's, sha256 312e3e13..., on all 35).
--   3. Per host: /en, which answers with a 302 whose Location is the
--      federation listing path (proven first on naga: /en ->
--      /en/federation/32/events/upcoming, its known path); for one host
--      (abjjc) /en answered 200 and the only federation linked was used.
--   4. Per host: that listing, run through the Scout's own
--      parseListingEvents; activated only if it read at least one event.
-- Each row's terms_reasoning carries its own timestamps and counts.
--
-- Not activated:
--   Non-grappling (no BJJ, no-gi or grappling events; held for the
--   founder's call): allamericansambo, allthingsjudo, americanjudo, judocomp, ktmdka, mdl, nanka, tba-sa, usajudo, usjf, wbcmtusa
--   Expired federation (their federation page says "Expired federation."
--   and lists nothing): abjjc, classiccombat
--
-- Disclosed: one malformed request was sent during this work
-- (abjjc.smoothcomp.com/en/federation/190%20adcc/events/upcoming, a shell
-- argument-splitting mistake, 2026-10-05T03:32:50Z). About 165 requests in
-- total, all at the 11-second pace.

